title: "openair-3-mcp-client-plugin-oss: IDE/agent client plugin for the openair-3-mcp server"
abstract: >-
  Client-side plugin (router skill, specialist skills, agent, MCP config)
  that wires AI IDE/agent clients (Claude, Cursor, Codex, VS Code) to the
  openair-3-mcp-server-oss server, enabling AI-driven air quality data
  ingestion and openair charting from chat.
